(HZ-001 A still-valid action is destroyed by a permissionless trigger in the same block) Tj T*
(  class 2 ordering   CONFIRMED ON THIS TARGET) Tj T*
(  Two exits are legal in the same block and pay opposite amounts. The transaction that lands first) Tj T*
(  decides, and the losing exit cannot be repaired because the other is already dead from its own clock.) Tj T*
(  What is at stake: one deal amount, which is the worker's entire payment on the affected deal.) Tj T*
(  What to do: Bound the still-valid exit by the same clock as the permissionless trigger, or document) Tj T*
(              which exit is authoritative after the window.) Tj T*
(  Reproduced here: confirmations/HZ-001-c2292af8.json - a rebuild of the verified source and the probes) Tj T*
(                   in it passed. Confirming behaviour, not intent.) Tj T*
(  matched by selectors: 0xe4725ba1 0x7c7a9804 0x82cbf88b) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HZ-005 Value arriving outside the accounting has no sweep) Tj T*
(  class 7 stranded-value   CONFIRMED ON THIS TARGET) Tj T*
(  A contract that pays out only from internal credits accepts forced native value or direct token) Tj T*
(  transfers, counts them in no total, and offers no function to recover them. Accounting stays correct,) Tj T*
(  so nothing breaks and nothing notices.) Tj T*
(  What is at stake: the stranded amount itself, unbounded by any ceiling.) Tj T*
(  What to do: Add a sweep for stray value, or document that it is donated.) Tj T*
(  Reproduced here: confirmations/HZ-005-c2292af8.json - a rebuild of the verified source and the probes) Tj T*
(                   in it passed. Confirming behaviour, not intent.) Tj T*
(  matched by selectors: 0x70b6fbec 0xb12ae89c 0x9b40b785) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HZ-009 Two permissionless exits are both legal in one block and pay opposite amounts) Tj T*
(  class 2 ordering   CONFIRMED ON THIS TARGET) Tj T*
(  Inside one block a stranger trigger and the buyer exit are both valid and settle the deal differently.) Tj T*
(  Block ordering alone decides who is paid, and the loser cannot repair afterwards because the other) Tj T*
(  path is already closed by its own clock.) Tj T*
(  What is at stake: one deal: full price on one ordering, zero on the other.) Tj T*
(  What to do: Define the authoritative exit for the overlap, or bound both paths by the same clock.) Tj T*
(  Reproduced here: confirmations/HZ-009-c2292af8.json - a rebuild of the verified source and the probes) Tj T*
(                   in it passed. Confirming behaviour, not intent.) Tj T*
